{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"Things you should read.","id":"850808447003656242","name":"combat-sign-up","position":7,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"Johnathan Wrask\n6'2\" green skinned Half-orc. He's got brown eye black slicked back hair going down to the back of his neck. He is most often seen with a smile on his face, rarely takes off his tunic which comes from the temple he serves. Often seen as dresses as a man out his century.Johnathan Wrask\n6'2\" green skinned Half-orc. https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Q_t0UJsTojGWaGxLmA-cDi6vAp0lH_PO9gElfCb7NWc/edit?usp=sharing","created_at":"2021-07-10T19:44:32.585000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-13T18:27:12.360000Z","id":"863505995887804436","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"Introduction. \nHe looks out into the ocean and towards the new world. He thinks about the memories he's had here. The last time he was here the french were invading, and he was ruthlessly commanding his airship to take them down in his first battle. And before that he was just a young lad, being raised by his godmother.\n\nHe closes his eyes and says, \"By the King's and God's will, I'm home\"","created_at":"2021-07-10T19:49:58.092000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863507361162985492","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"ddys9du-458ecc76-9954-41cf-a64e-30226d5eaabf.png","id":"863507684107354112","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863507684107354112-ddys9du-458ecc76-9954-41cf-a64e-30226d5eaabf.png","message_id":"863507684417077308","sha256":"e92f1af1867bd97aa5435e3541ea663c4812ed62d62b4a6348ce6f74cc18a68f","size":1394537,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863507684107354112/ddys9du-458ecc76-9954-41cf-a64e-30226d5eaabf.png?ex=6ac0b3f3&is=6abf6273&hm=5d84bea0c687fc8da68c4ba8546c2d13184fc84494d2eea32d2ff9ef6d86b5ca&"}],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"","created_at":"2021-07-10T19:51:15.162000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863507684417077308","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"**Mictlan** doesn't have a strong conception of what life is supposed to be like in the city, or anywhere, really. That's what you get from being raised in a city of angels. They are quite tall (taller, if you count the halo and wings) and slim, a puzzled smile typically the most common expression on them. For a bundle of wings and eyes, they're kind of awkward, never quite sure what they're looking at. They clutch a book to themself, curiosity in their numerous eyes as they quite clearly have no idea where they're going.","created_at":"2021-07-10T20:07:48.707000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863511851648417792","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
