{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"Tortillini has known a life of narrowly escaping disaster after disaster. Nearly every vessel he has traveled on, be it pirate, merchant, or royal navy, met an unfortunate end, with Tortillini miraculously surviving each disaster. After the pirate ship he was on combusted under mysterious circumstances, Tortillini stole a life boat and navigated his way to the nearest port.","created_at":"2021-07-10T20:14:23.374000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-10T20:14:29.420000Z","id":"863513507000877066","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
