{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Siren","id":"809288447151439872","is_bot":0,"username":"sirenssong17"},"author_id":"809288447151439872","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"Paeton Kane is a 25 year old, 6 foot tall, Witch (Sorceror) with Dark hair and brilliant sapphire blue eyes. He wears a black cloak, a product of the times, and black, blue and white clothing made from commonly found materials. \n\nPaeton only recently arrived in Empire City, from across the country, where his mother, sister, and boyfriend still live. He has been instructed by his mother, the Witch of Serenade City, to seek the guidance of a master sorceror, and learn everything that he can from them. \n\nWhile he is here, he plans to do just that, however, he also plans to give aide to the common folk of this city, wherever possible.","created_at":"2021-07-10T20:48:50.661000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863522177831665684","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
