{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"unknown.png","id":"863523358977425408","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/850808447003656242/863523358977425408-unknown.png","message_id":"863523359186092053","sha256":"410b7a6b76b0e51b9d618e083ba2432615cd84fedd18dcafd47ec332cf70ed4b","size":643396,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/850808447003656242/863523358977425408/unknown.png?ex=6ac0c28c&is=6abf710c&hm=2543b0273019ffc886c5452b4c232e18b662b0ddc027e7173c0fcf57acf395e0&"}],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"850808447003656242","content":"Oft seen acting as a statue in one of the many parks in Ferrytown and oft not seen smuggling what little they can from Hampsted into Ferrytown. \n\nEasily recognizable by their striking purple hair that shoots for the sky, wooden piercings that decorate their face, and the smell of a burnt fae leaf, but still somehow just as easily lost on a crowded street or busy park.\n\nKevin is a strange Kimmelian Gnome of few words and many bodily gestures. Most, if not all, communication from them comes in the form of expressions and gesturing. Some believe it's because they were cursed into silence, some say it's their vow, and others theorize Kevin just doesn't have anything to say. Only Kevin knows and they aren't telling.\n\nRegardless of how much they don't say, Kevin is usually incredibly helpful and high spirited (and I do mean **high**).","created_at":"2021-07-10T20:53:32.318000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863523359186092053","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
